  <name>PublicApi</name>
  <type>serdocumentation:PublicApi</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>serialize() entry point (B26)</is>

  <documentation>serialize(document: BomDocument, options?: SerializeOptions): SerializeResult

    SerializeOptions (owned by @blockml/bom):
    • indent — default 2; pretty-print spaces (B13); 0 = compact
    • xmlDeclaration — default false; omit &lt;?xml …?> (B17/B24)

    SerializeResult (owned by @blockml/bom):
    • text — string | null (null only if serialize cannot produce text)
    • diagnostics — Diagnostic[]
    • success — false if any diagnostic has severity === "error"

    Behaviour:
    • Emit per B12–B25 / D8–D9 (authoredPlacement, authoredCharacterDataForm)
    • BML_NAMESPACE_UNBOUND → error diagnostic; prefer still emitting text when possible
    • Does NOT call the validator — host decides abort-on-diagnostics
    • Sync only; no throw on recoverable errors
    • Never write UTF-8 BOM on output

    Not in V1 API: serializeFile, async variants, streaming.</documentation>

  <references>
    <see type="bomapi:SerializeOptions" relation="Defines"></see>
    <see type="bomapi:SerializeResult" relation="Defines"></see>
    <see type="sercap:Serialize" relation="Defines"></see>
    <see type="serdocumentation:EmitOrder" relation="ReadNext"></see>
  </references>

</block>
